## Model weights and third-party content

**No model weights are hosted in this repository.** This repository only *documents* models. Every model family retains its
own license (Apache 2.0, MIT, Llama Community License, custom terms, etc.) — see README §20. Downloading, fine-tuning, or
shipping any model requires reading and accepting **that model's** license from its canonical source (Hugging Face / GitHub /
vendor site).

